        <h2>Mobile information — we do not share</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or share mobile phone numbers or SMS opt-in information with third parties or affiliates for their marketing or any other purpose. Mobile information is used only to reply to you and to operate our customer-care SMS program (quotes, scheduling, and service questions).</p>

        <h2>How you opt in to SMS</h2>
        <p>You opt in by sending the first text to <a href="sms:+16506696890">+1 (650) 669-6890</a> after seeing that number on this website. You may also text START, YES, or UNSTOP to that number. We only reply to people who text us first. We do not buy lists or send unsolicited blasts.</p>
        <p>If you submit a quote form on this site, SMS starts only if you check the optional consent box (it is unchecked by default and is not required to submit the form).</p>

        <h2>Message frequency</h2>
        <p>Message frequency varies based on your questions. Typical threads are a few messages while we schedule a free evaluation or photo quote.</p>

        <h2>Rates</h2>
        <p>Message and data rates may apply.</p>

        <h2>Opt out and help</h2>
        <p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to unsubscribe. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help. You may also call <a href="tel:+17048396126">704-839-6126</a>.</p>

        <h2>Other information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you use our quote, financing eligibility, or warranty forms, we collect name, phone, email, and property details as needed to quote and install. We do not sell customer lists.</p>

        <p><a href="/terms/">SMS Terms and Conditions</a> · <a href="/about/">About SAFE</a></p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated: September 7, 2026</p>
    </div>
</section>
